## What this repository does NOT contain

- **No Battlestate Games code or assets.** No `bsg.*.dll`, no `UnityEngine*.dll`, no
  commercial Unity assets (DOTween, Sirenix/Odin, Dissonance), no `Assembly-CSharp`
  interop dumps, no `GameAssembly.dll`, no game data (`EscapeFromTarkov_Data`).
- **No SPT binaries.** `hollowed.dll` and the `spt-*.dll` assemblies are not redistributed;
  they are resolved from the user's own SPT installation at build time via `-p:GameDir`.
- **No user data.** No profiles, no session logs, no credentials.

